20:38.680 --> 20:41.040
I'm being chased by bad guys!

20:41.040 --> 20:42.010
What is that? How cute.
I'm being chased by bad guys!

20:42.010 --> 20:43.200
What is that? How cute.

20:43.200 --> 20:45.050
